+## Phase 3: User Story 7 — Generación de Informe por Departamento (Priority: P1) 🎯 MVP
+
+**Goal**: RRHH puede seleccionar tipo de informe y rango de fechas y obtener una tabla agrupada por departamento con métricas de absentismo o uso de vacaciones, con desglose expandible por empleado.
+
+**Independent Test**: Ejecutar `DepartmentReportIntegrationTest` con datos de demo, verificando que los totales departamentales coinciden con la suma de filas individuales y que `GET /api/v1/reports` retorna `403` con rol `EMPLEADO`.
+
+### Backend Implementation
+
+- [x] T006 [P] [US7] Create `DepartmentReportRepository` with four query methods (`findEmployeesForPeriod`, `summarizeDepartments`, `sumApprovedDaysWithinPeriod`, `findApprovedRequestsCrossingPeriodBoundary`) using native SQL and JPQL in `backend/src/main/java/com/iw/rrhh/report/repository/DepartmentReportRepository.java`
+- [x] T007 [P] [US7] Create `DepartmentReportService` interface and `DepartmentReportServiceImpl` with `generateReport(type, startDate, endDate)` and `exportCsv(report)` methods in `backend/src/main/java/com/iw/rrhh/report/service/`; implement vacation proration by hire month and working-day calculation via `HolidayCalendarService`; division-by-zero safe (returns `0.00`)
+- [x] T008 [US7] Create `DepartmentReportController` with `@PreAuthorize("hasRole('RRHH')")` on class level, `GET /reports` returning `DepartmentReportResponse` and `GET /reports/export` returning `byte[]` CSV; both endpoints call the same service method to guarantee parity (FR-004) in `backend/src/main/java/com/iw/rrhh/report/controller/DepartmentReportController.java`
+- [x] T009 [P] [US7] Create `DepartmentReportDemoDataInitializer` (`@Component`, `@Profile("test")`) that inserts demo employees, contracts and leave requests for Testcontainers integration tests in `backend/src/main/java/com/iw/rrhh/report/config/DepartmentReportDemoDataInitializer.java`
+- [x] T010 [US7] Create integration test `DepartmentReportIntegrationTest` (Testcontainers + MockMvc) covering: correct department aggregation; individual employee rows sum equals department total; `hasData: false` for empty period; `403` for `EMPLEADO` and `RESPONSABLE_EQUIPO` roles; `204` from `/export` when no data; CSV BOM and RFC 4180 format; partial-period requests correctly trimmed by `HolidayCalendarService` in `backend/src/test/java/com/iw/rrhh/report/DepartmentReportIntegrationTest.java`
+
